  "description": "Bowire Interceptor — unified Intercept rail (v2.2 rail-IA refactor; replaces Mocks + Traffic + the already-hidden Proxy + Intercepted descriptors) with four sub-tabs (Captured | Live overrides | Mock servers | Settings) + the in-process UseBowireInterceptor() middleware that captures HTTP flows into a singleton InterceptedFlowStore + the InterceptorMockStore that lets workbench-defined rules short-circuit the pipeline + the BowireReverseProxyHost / ReverseProxyRegistry the Tools surface uses to drive standalone reverse-proxy hosts. Mounts /api/intercepted/* (+ /api/traffic/* alias) endpoints.",
